ent building boasts of exclusivity and a unique style with lots of modern amenities surrounding it.\nL205: The locality offers residents privacy and a homely feel amidst a stylish setting, and the vicinity is a well-known hotspot for Malaysia’s expatriate community and high-end professionals.\nL206: There are several educational institutions that are located close to Cliveden @plaza damas 3; they include Mont Kiara International School, Garden International school, Sekolah Kebangsaan Segambut Makmur, Mahsa University College (PBD), Sekolah Kebangsaan Taman Sri Sinar, Sekolah Kebangsaan Taman Tun Dr Ismail 2, International Institute of Islamic thought and civilization, French school of Kuala Lumpur, University of Sheffield South East Asia Office, Taylor's College Sri Hartamas, SK Bukit Damansara and Mont Royale College.\nL207: Also in the neighborhood are other upmarket shopping centers for residents to visit; these shopping facilities include Solaris Mont Kiara, Kompleks Shoplex Mont' Kiara, Publika Shopping gallery, One Mont Kiara, Kiara supermarket Sdn Bhd and Solaris Dutamas. Also, residents can find lots of eateries offering cuisine from local to international dishes located a few minutes away from Cliveden premises.\nL208: Common hangouts situated close to the development include the Asian Terrace cafe, Souled-Out café, Groove junction and Hartamas square. Nearby healthcare facilities include Global Doctors Hospital, Mont Kiara Dental Specialist Clinic, Klinik Mont Hope, KL Dental Surgery, Damansara Heights Dental Centre and Dharan Total Wellness Clinic.\nL209: For recreational and relaxation purposes, residents of Cliveden @plaza damas 3 can visit nearby facilities such as Bukit Kiara Equestrian Club, the Sime Darby Convention center and the Kuala Lumpur Golf & Country Club are all located within a 2-minute radius from the property. The apartment building is well-connected via the Jalan Duta-Sungai Buloh highway, the North-South highway, the Sprint highway and the Duta-Ulu Kelang highway. Sri Hartamas is about 5 minutes away from Kuala Lumpur’s city center.\nL210: Rapid KL buses and city taxi are available within the vicinity to provide easy access to major areas in the city.\nL211: Cliveden condominium offers exclusive facilities for its residents to enjoy, these facilities include a clubhouse, a gymnasium centre, a playground for kids, a swimming pool, a wading pool, a game room, a Jacuzzi, a sauna room, a spa & steam room, a function room, a 4-storey building covered car park for residents & visitors and 24-hour state of art security and surveillance to ensure safety with the perimeter. This serviced apartment is a single block of 5-storey tower that houses 180 residential units.\nL212: It has three typical layouts for buyers to select from. Type c & type c1 are studio apartment with a built-up size of 495 square feet and 595 square feet respectively while the type c3 is a 2-bedroom unit with a built-up size of 940 square feet. The residential apartment is fully furnished with quality appliances that include water storage facilities. The launching price for this development was RM 310,000 - RM 2,310,000 and a maintenance fee of RM0.35 per square feet.\nL213: Other projects by the same developer are Maytower, Palazio, Parc Regency Serviced Apartment, Prima Regency Service Apartment and Royal Domain Sri Putramas 2. Other developments within the neighborhood include Changkat View Condominium, Windsor Tower and Carlton @ Plaza Damas 3.\nL214: cite58†Read more L215: \nL216: Project details\nL217: \nL218: Type Service Residence\nL219: \nL220: Price RM 275K - 425K\nL221: \nL222: Completion year 2009\nL223: \nL224: Tenure Freehold\nL225: \nL226: No. of blocks 1\nL227: \nL228: No. of floors 5\nL229: \nL230: Total units 180\nL231: \nL232: * * *\nL233: \nL234: Top facilities\nL235: \nL236: 24-hour security\nL237: \nL238: Covered car park\nL239: \nL240: Gym\nL241: \nL242: Jacuzzi\nL243: \nL244: * * *\nL245: \nL246: Developer M